    {
      "kind": "divider"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "You assess a foe's weaknesses in combat and use them to formulate a plan of attack against your enemy. Choose a creature you can see and roll a d20. If you Strike the chosen creature later this round, you must use the result of the roll you made to Devise a Stratagem for your Strike's attack roll instead of rolling. You make this substitution only for the first Strike you make against the creature this round, not any subsequent attacks.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": " When you make this substitution, you can also add your Intelligence modifier to your attack roll instead of your Strength or Dexterity modifier, provided your Strike uses an ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "agile",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "trait/agile"
        },
        {
          "content": " or ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "finesse",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "trait/finesse"
        },
        {
          "content": " melee weapon, an agile or finesse unarmed attack, a ranged weapon (which must be agile or finesse if it's a melee weapon with the ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "thrown",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "trait/thrown"
        },
        {
          "content": " trait), or a ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "sap",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "weapon/sap"
        },
        {
          "content": ". ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "If you're aware that the creature you choose is the subject of a lead you're pursuing, you can use this ability as a free action.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
